  <!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
  <div class="panel" id="panel-about" role="tabpanel">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="kicker">About us</span>
        <h1>Good food starts with good ingredients.</h1>
        <p>Fill your kitchen with the kind of freshness you can see, feel and taste — from vibrant fruits and crisp veggies to everyday groceries.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="crate-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <section>
      <div class="wrap about">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:18px;">Fresh for your kitchen. Better for your table.</h2>
          <p>We're a family-run fruit and vegetable store in the middle of Gympie, tucked inside Goldfields Plaza on Nash St. Our aim is simple: fill the shelves with produce that's genuinely fresh, sourced as close to home as we can manage, and priced fairly for everyday shopping.</p>
          <p>From vibrant fruit and crisp veggies to the everyday groceries that round out a shopping list, we want this to be the easy stop that makes your kitchen better — not just fuller.</p>
          <p>We're proudly local, and proud to be part of the Gympie community. Drop in, say hello, and let us know what you're after — if we don't have it, we'll try to get it in.</p>
